  <item>
    <title>EP.20 咱课本上除了岳飞谁还敢纹身？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62a31c59d02ea2b34ca88922</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62a31c59d02ea2b34ca88922</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Jun 2022 10:26:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嚯！用了十年的课本，竟然在其中发现了帝国主义的阴谋诡计。</span></p><span></span><p><span>何方妖孽，亮个国旗，报上名来！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 人教版教材竟然搞了个大新闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 虽然肯定不可能，但可不可能只是画风问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 教材编订流程的问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 在我们打字之前……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 虽然肯定不可能，但可不可能只是淫者见淫？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> 我们有没有考证信息真实性的义务？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 又是这帮怪力乱神咯？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> 在逃毒教材，逍遥法外长达十年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">23:57</a>运动式的整改只会带来取消文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1553">25:53</a> 我们心中的教材插画</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Kids &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;MGMT</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>这里是《飞越疯人院》，我们是阿飞和越越，两个定居魔都的30+岁男子。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
