  <item>
    <title>EP.18 疫情隔离让我对时间的感知出了问题？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/626d0d633e8abf901a68d7ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">626d0d633e8abf901a68d7ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Apr 2022 10:20:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>隔离伊始，居家办公，工作量骤减。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这让阿飞和越越一跃成为时间暴发户。</span></p><span></span><p><span>然而，无休无止的核酸和抢菜，逐渐把两位新晋时间领主打回贫农阶级。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天阿飞和越越尝试探寻时间的究极奥秘。</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实也没有那么玄乎，只是看一看还能为低效率找出什么别的借口。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 我们最近的作息变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 被封在家可不等于放假</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 隔离期间那支离破碎的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 时间效率工具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1731">28:51</a> 留神别掉进infinity pool</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2266">37:46</a> Multitasking是假象？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2591">43:11</a> 碎片时间来自内卷？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3069">51:09</a> 速食文化的迷思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3630">60:30</a> </span><em><span>We don't build the lives we want by saving time, we build the lives we want and then time saves itself.</span></em><span> &nbsp;--- &nbsp;Laura Vanderkam</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3775">62:55</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mama's Gun &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;Glass Animals</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍推荐：Make Time &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;Jake Knapp</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>这里是《飞越疯人院》，我们是阿飞和越越，两个定居魔都的30+岁男子。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmxn2OOSVQaFZHtHu1sV01pZsU0P.m4a" length="130045249" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvigX7kc3fM16nkgm7uBgMdxDCIA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP.17 这次咱要飞的是封人院</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62569984493ea2f504a558b5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62569984493ea2f504a558b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Apr 2022 09:36:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>原以为我们播客的名字只是一个平平无奇的谐音梗，没想到一年后一语成谶。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2022年上海的春天竟然是在封闭中开启的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>控制灵魂对自由的渴望，是一场修行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我只想问，这科我不修行不行？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> Disclaimer: &nbsp;封闭期间我们的个人感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 封闭前24小时你在干嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 工作方式和状态的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> 越越卸甲归田的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1482">24:42</a>远亲不如近邻，近亲不能通婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1917">31:57</a> 关于正能量的传播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2056">34:16</a> 依然感谢在黑夜奔跑的人们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 一些祝福</span></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2206">36:46</a> Outro:</span></h2><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不正当游戏中的正当玩家 &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;刺猬</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>这里是《飞越疯人院》，我们是阿飞和越越，两个定居魔都的30+岁男子。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
