  <item>
    <title>EP.14 害，不就过个圣诞而已嘛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61c475de898eaed5965075c3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61c475de898eaed5965075c3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Dec 2021 13:13:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又到了一年一度的跨年前倒数第七天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这疫情防控的关键时刻，我们敦促圣塔·克劳斯先生（a.k.a. 圣诞老人），入乡随俗，遵守当地防疫规定，主动配合核酸检测，低调开展礼物派送工作。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 圣诞和春节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 我们传统节日的现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> 跟着“群体”和“地域”过节日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 节日欢乐的来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 当我们反对洋节，我们在反对什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="917">15:17</a> 宗教、消费主义、意识形态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> 阿飞的圣诞回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a> 越越的圣诞回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Last Christmast &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;Wham!</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>这里是《飞越疯人院》，我们是阿飞和越越，两个定居魔都的30+岁男子。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、随音、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
