  <item>
    <title>EP.13 2021国企漫游：一张报纸一杯茶，上班把酒话桑麻？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61b88de9898eaed59650736e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61b88de9898eaed59650736e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Dec 2021 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听，那是什么声音？</span></p><span></span><p><span>熟悉却又陌生…</span></p><span></span><p><span>是李老师网上冲浪的鼠标声，</span></p><span></span><p><span>是张主任凝视K线图的哀叹声，</span></p><span></span><p><span>是周姐的门牙和瓜子清脆的挤压声，</span></p><span></span><p><span>是时间悄悄溜走的脚步声，</span></p><span></span><p><span>也是退休倒数计时的曼妙钟声。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人们对于国企有着偏颇且刻板的误解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你一定听到过“一杯茶，一支烟，一张报纸看半天”这样的俏皮话。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但显然这样的描然对于当下的职场环境早已不适用了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为室内禁烟了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们邀请到马来西亚的朋友Albert，和大家聊聊他作为一名外企派驻人员，与国企的“第三类接触”。同时我们尝试打破一些关于国企的刻板印象，可能成功，也可能不太成功。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 本期嘉宾---Albert</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a> 今日话题---国企</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> 越越对国企刻板印象：死气沉沉？等级森严？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="586">09:46</a> Disclaimer：本次聊天内容不公正，不客观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 国企的“死板”和“划水”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> 辨证看待国企的职场氛围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 国企是职场八卦集中地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1319">21:59</a> 书记让我们畅所欲言！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> “因为我们是国企”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> 外企高到哪里去？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1934">32:14</a> 奇怪的周报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2157">35:57</a> 国企的“人情味”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2499">41:39</a> 阿飞和Albert与国企的最初渊源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2841">47:21</a> Toxic workplace和职场霸凌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3355">55:55</a> 让我们强行辨证一下！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3597">59:57</a> Ambiguity和平均主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3842">64:02</a> 格格不入的iMac</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4103">68:23</a> 格格不入的Suit &amp; Tie</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4661">77:41</a> 越越和娱乐圈国企</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5052">84:12</a> 阿飞屠龙少年的初心，以及Albert的理性展望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5333">88:53</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>明天不上班 &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;谢帝</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>这里是《飞越疯人院》，我们是阿飞和越越，两个定居魔都的30+岁男子。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、随音、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
