  <item>
    <title>EP.12 人不装B枉少年，也枉青年，还枉中年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61a1a65b88e440902acd0ccd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61a1a65b88e440902acd0ccd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Nov 2021 03:30:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上海的冬天没有雨，但总能让毛毛想起在英国求学的日子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他享受在特拉法加广场的长椅上片刻的放空。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他害怕南肯辛顿名流雅士无休止的聚会邀约。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他记得在希斯罗机场饱含热泪，细语低吟《再别康桥》时的惆怅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“这些都是过去了，不提也罢。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>毛毛取出古驰眼镜盒里的苹果正品抛光布，轻轻擦拭眼镜片上淡薄的雾气，继续朗声诵道，</span></p><span></span><p><span>“七彩的棱镜住进我的眼睛，</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一束折射是光线的谎言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>回忆褪去了彩色的伪装，</span></p><span></span><p><span>显露出苍白的身体和荆棘的冠冕，</span></p><span></span><p><span>负笈远行的学子，</span></p><span></span><p><span>何时回到那座望不到日落的圣殿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将不必忍受黑夜的孤单，</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的食粮是荣耀，爱情和…辣肉面。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>说罢，毛毛抹了抹嘴，问阿飞，”你点的浇头味道可好？“</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">01:29</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> Wingman阿飞吹一波本期嘉宾---校友毛毛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 今日话题---装逼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 薛定谔的装逼，装逼和牛逼的叠加态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 机场文学和科恩兄妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a> 关于影视作品审美的优越感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> 阿飞的meta装逼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a> 无恶意吐槽好友的装逼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a> 从留学经历到外企人员的装逼语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3259">54:19</a> 对装逼的忌惮已经影响到了表达的欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3761">62:41</a> 不希望自己的喜好成为主流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4482">74:42</a> 装逼产生鄙视链？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4816">80:16</a> 阿飞无厘头的电影鄙视链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5057">84:17</a> 装逼的银色内衬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5694">94:54</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fake &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;Lauv/Conan Gray</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>这里是《飞越疯人院》，我们是阿飞和越越，两个定居魔都的30+岁男子。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、随音、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台​​​更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
