  <item>
    <title>EP.11 尝一尝消费馅饼，批一批消费陷阱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6194f24cc2c27ba92b0148e3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6194f24cc2c27ba92b0148e3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Nov 2021 12:15:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>现代消费社会奇观1：越越在成为房奴前，先成为了毛巾架奴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>现代消费社会奇观2：只因一次误触直播带货，阿飞苦心经营多年的极简主义者形象被揭穿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>现代消费社会奇观3：越越和阿飞一边狠批饭圈经济，一边心甘情愿成为文化周边的俘虏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>消费主义无孔不入，防不胜防。即便是自我标榜清心寡欲，也难独善其身。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从另一个角度来说，消费主义虽然庸俗，但是欢乐。虽然可怕，倒也可敬。</span></p><span></span><p><span>或许最好的应对方式就是与之共栖共生，反正反抗也没用。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> Catch up: 我们都喜欢《沙丘》和佐杜大爷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> Catch up: 我们也可以学习True Crime类型播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 聊聊自己和身边的消费主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 同时“顺从”和“对抗”消费主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a> 消费主义对不同消费者的精准打击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a> “反正也不贵”“凑单”“优惠券”…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1268">21:08</a> 曼联球迷和追星一族的比较</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 过度消费、超前消费、消费贷等“陷阱”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 平台的小游戏、积分、膨胀金等套娃玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1933">32:13</a> 大数据技术无罪，但也可以杀熟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> “景观社会”：颜值即正义，标签化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 贩卖焦虑（负景观）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">38:06</a> 消费性节日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a> 消费的可能是符号和标签</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2800">46:40</a> 怎么和消费主义相处？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3124">52:04</a> 一个理想化的呼吁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3296">54:56</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wing$ &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;Macklemore</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>这里是《飞越疯人院》，我们是阿飞和越越，两个定居魔都的30+岁男子。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、随音、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台​​​更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
