    <guid isPermaLink="false">617b9989c890259cb983e281</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Oct 2021 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前阵子，我们随着通利福尼亚顶流明星——威震天，学习到了一个热词，即“社交NB症”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对各种慕名前来合影的“愚蠢的人类”，威震天通通轻松应(tiao)对(xi)，可见“社交NB症”能量之巨大。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是这回我们就聊聊“社交NB症”这个热词，也会和上回串台聊到的“社死”以及“社恐（越越自认为是非轻微社恐患者）”“社交牛杂症状”“外向型社恐”等概念有所交织。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（以上是越越的流水账文案）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> Catch up: 阿飞分享纪录片《911总统作战室》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a> Catch up: 越越分享“惬意”十一旅行经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 威震天——社交NB症深度患者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 阿飞的社交NB技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> 社交NB和社交牛杂、社恐、社死等热词的交织</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">22:59</a> 我们的外向型社恐症状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">27:45</a> 有些人的社交NB似乎是尴尬的自嗨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1818">30:18</a> 社交NB和社死也就一念之差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 阿飞的魔术表演经历对其社交技巧的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">40:32</a> 伴随社交技巧的还有同理心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 为什么会成为热词？从社恐说起，到性，到戒备心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3142">52:22</a> “社交不NB”是国人的群体惯性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3282">54:42</a> 坦然面对社交NB和社死…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3506">58:26</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Smooth Operator &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;Big Daddy Kane</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>越越 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>这里是《飞越疯人院》，我们是阿飞和越越，两个定居魔都的30+岁男子。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、随音、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台​​​更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
