  <item>
    <title>EP.9 社死时刻，看我们用脚趾抠出一个阿斯加德</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/617020c97e390a2de9e020b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">617020c97e390a2de9e020b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Oct 2021 13:59:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>很高兴迎来了播客的第一次串台，也在这里为大家隆重介绍：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61164144cb0b82e1df0ad0d8?s=eyJ1IjoiNjA4MGY5YWZlMGY1ZTcyM2JiMjJkNjljIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61164144cb0b82e1df0ad0d8?s=eyJ1IjoiNjA4MGY5YWZlMGY1ZTcyM2JiMjJkNjljIn0%3D"><span>Not Bad Club 潦草好</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>原先计划聊的主题是：三十岁前后的心态差异。</span></p><span></span><p><span>得知主题后，心理年龄只有18岁的阿飞瞬间警觉，防御机制kicks in：难不成潦草好的两位姑娘把我们两位30+岁的老人家当做了活体标本做研究？</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞对于自己30+的这个事实，向来采取的是不拒绝，不接受的态度。</span></p><span></span><p><span>眼瞅就要退休了，岂能在这节骨眼上被年轻人当街示众，公开处刑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不行，得聊点别的！</span></p><span></span><p><span>此刻必须祭出一个更大的尴尬，来掩盖自己三十知天命的事实。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不如就聊聊社死吧？</span></p><span></span><p><span>宁愿用脚趾抠出一个阿斯加德，也不能抠出一座养老院啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（以上是阿飞若有似无，未必真实的心理活动）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 串台双方阵容介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> 串台的理由……也很潦草</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a> 我们对播客的认识以及我们做播客中的小故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1264">21:04</a> 我们对播客这个媒介的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 互爆芳龄，引出了社死和30岁两大话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">28:53</a> 被大纲支配的八喜开启社死话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1976">32:56</a> 阿飞的整蛊社死故事分享大会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">35:13</a> 社死重灾区——微信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2905">48:25</a> 社死和尴尬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3164">52:44</a> 阿飞又一个高能社死经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> 强行收尾！30岁话题留给下一回串台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3558">59:18</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Please Mr. Postman &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;Carpenters</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>这里是《飞越疯人院》，我们是阿飞和越越，两个定居魔都的30+岁男子。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、随音、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台​​​更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
