  <item>
    <title>EP.8 做一行，爱一行，明天咱们就转行！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6164338484910d43c3087b29</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6164338484910d43c3087b29</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Oct 2021 12:52:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>低默契组合，阿飞和越越，终于在共事两个月后，找到了两人的共同点：转行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>若干年前，阿飞完成了从国企朝九晚五到影像创作的转行。而越越也正在朝着内容创造的方向奔跑前行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>更巧的是，两人的转行都伴随着极高的意气用事和极低的自知之明。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的节目里试着探讨一下30+是否是一个很好的转行时机。</span></p><span></span><p><span>越越：是不是都不要紧了，因为已经裸辞了。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> 阿飞分享电影《南巫》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> 越越对于听音乐和听播客的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">15:58</a> 进入正题：转行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1199">19:59</a> 转行原因的2x2矩阵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a> 年纪对于转行的尴尬影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 求职申请表上会泄露隐私信息吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1628">27:08</a> 裸辞转行的压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> 越越对于转行的灵（zhe）魂（xue）拷问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1976">32:56</a> 转行还会带来什么压力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2304">38:24</a> 转行的timing</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2503">41:43</a> 不考虑物质需求的情况下最想从事的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3267">54:27</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Goodbye Yellow Brick Road &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;Elton John</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>这里是《飞越疯人院》，我们是阿飞和越越，两个定居魔都的30+岁男子。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、随音、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台​​​更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
