    <guid isPermaLink="false">61487148e2eddc76ba3b0582</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Sep 2021 11:32:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>中秋佳节倍思亲，可是这年头在中秋节备受关注的反而是各个大厂出品的月饼礼盒，似乎中秋佳节变成了一件纯职场相关的事儿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们就聊一聊月饼礼盒这个比较“油腻”的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>顺便祝福听友们今年中秋有收到喜爱的月饼~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>划重点：墙裂建议1.2倍速播放，最后听歌请切回原速！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> ABBA时隔40年发布新作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">14:51</a> 导演们的独立debut里有宝藏！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>《约翰逊一家的怪事》剧透，可点此选择跳过剧情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 那些送月饼的礼仪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> He's a Re-Gifter!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> 越越真的不是个喜欢送礼的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a> 送礼送实体的好，还是送票好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2706">45:06</a> 各种花里胡哨的月饼礼盒。阿里、奢侈品、宛平南路、宠物月饼…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3606">60:06</a> 给你一盒虚拟月饼，降格成你的虚拟好友！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4110">68:30</a> 外公收到的月饼越来越少，曲终人不散，日久见真心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4616">76:56</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Gimme! Gimme! Gimme! (A Man After Midnight) &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;ABBA</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>两个定居魔都的30+岁男子和你随便聊聊。我们是阿飞和越越，这里是《飞越疯人院》。我们随便聊聊泛文化，当代生活以及我们眼中的人类状况。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>之后节目会陆续在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、荔枝播客、汽水儿、网易云音乐、QQ音乐、皮艇、随音、Apple Podcast、Spotify等平台​​​更新上线。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
