    <title>EP.6 约个球吗？足球篮球都行！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6140571478f21acb17abd0da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6140571478f21acb17abd0da</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Sep 2021 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期节目不听也罢，领夹麦给阿飞和越越带来了无与伦比的松弛感，直接导致口腔失禁，嘚吧嘚聊了两个小时。特别前45分钟唠嗑还没进入正题[狗头]</span></p><span></span><p><span>请各位酌情收听，谨慎收听。不要浪费人生中宝贵的两个小时。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>划重点：墙裂建议1.2倍速播放，最后听歌请切回原速！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timestamps:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 漫威真香！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a> 从The Green Knight到A24</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2099">34:59</a> 装修书籍推荐，和设计师的博弈，以及想要的家的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2942">49:02</a> C罗回归曼联！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3089">51:29</a> 足球迷篮球迷支持球队还是人蜜？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3365">56:05</a> 30+的我们约球难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4229">70:29</a> 球场穿着的变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5112">85:12</a> 球“痰”风云再起！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5517">91:57</a> 野球场上的肢体碰撞和真正的强硬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5748">95:48</a> 打的不是球，打的是人情世故！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6718">111:58</a> 玩过的一些球类游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7039">117:19</a> 打球之于我们的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7352">122:32</a> Intro of ending song</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7449">124:09</a> Outro:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Basketball &nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;&nbsp;Kurtis Blow</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越越 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：越越浴室Sebastian</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿飞 &nbsp;&nbsp;微博/即刻：阿飞_SH</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>两个定居魔都的30+岁男子和你随便聊聊。